{"id":"final","lemma":"final","pos":"adj","rank":316,"glosses":["final (last, ultimate)","final (conclusive, decisive)"],"ipa":"/fiˈnal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"finales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-final.wav","examples":[{"text":"Este es el final de mi historia.","en":"This is the end of my story.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/805989","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"history"}]},{"text":"¿Dónde está el final de esta fila?","en":"Where is the end of this line?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514875","words":[null,null,{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"line, row, rank, file"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"where are you?"],[4,6,"definitely this time"]]},{"text":"¿Hay un final feliz para esta historia?","en":"Is there a happy ending to this story?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582635","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"happy, merry"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"history"}]},{"text":"No me gustó el final de esa película.","en":"I didn't like the ending of that movie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594924","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"film"}]},{"text":"Eso ocurrió a finales de octubre.","en":"That happened in late October.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"October"}]}]}